      511.31,
      289.36,
      581.61
    ],
    "text": "2016/8/3-4HA378. I hereby give notice, under Sub- section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire/Servitude right over the following land, which is required for a public purpose :",
