  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      580.91,
      289.36,
      689.39
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired/Servitude right : All that allotment of land called \u201cSendiriyamulla watta\u201d in total extent of about 0.0065Ha, depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Cadastral Map of the Surveyor General\u2019s Plan No. C.M. 410509 and dated 28.02.2024, situated at the Village of Sendiriyamulla, in the Divisional Secretariat Dankotuwa in Puttalam District, North Western Province and bounded as follows:",
