      459.23,
      541.83,
      516.81
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Dankotuwa on the 15th July, 2024, at 10.30 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
